# source: kind: web; name: Official Russian Pokémon TCG card translations (Sun & Moon series, XY Evolutions), The Pokémon Company International; address: tcg-ru; quoted term: Бридер Покемонов; relation: alternative; verification: recorded; related notes: note:91939343-b3a0-5e09-9ccf-079e6e603063
